# Keep the bytes in the repository identical on every platform. Claim freshness
# and the proof digests are computed from file contents, so a checkout that
# rewrites line endings must never leak into a commit.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bend text eol=lf
*.tla text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.cmd -text
*.png binary
*.gguf binary
